  "Written 2026-11-03 from the build's definitions only (exec/workflow_*.md SCRIPT code, builder/assumptions.md A3, F2, X5); nothing was run.",
  "Input convention (A3, and inFile() in every batch SCRIPT): input.files[<file name>] holds the file as one string (lines split at \\n) or a list of lines; outputs are top-level END keys named after the contract file without its extension; <step>_rc is set only on an error or warnings (A3, A4).",
